WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.000
-Hey, guys, we're here
at McNally Jackson bookstore

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.567
in midtown Manhattan, and we're
about to surprise some people

00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:06.567
who think that they're part
of a promotional campaign

00:00:06.567 --> 00:00:09.501
for Michelle Obama's new book,
"The Light We Carry."

00:00:09.501 --> 00:00:11.868
They're going to press a button
to hear inspirational quotes

00:00:11.868 --> 00:00:14.100
from the former First Lady,
Michelle Obama.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:16.901
But what they don't know is
that the real Michelle Obama

00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:18.734
will be reading them
the quotes live.

00:00:18.734 --> 00:00:20.467
-That is me.
-Ready?

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:21.701
-Let's do this.

00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:27.434
♪♪

00:00:27.434 --> 00:00:30.133
-I was going to
get this one, too.

00:00:30.133 --> 00:00:32.200
-Please press the button.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.901
♪♪

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:37.701
Please press the button to hear
an inspirational quote

00:00:37.701 --> 00:00:40.000
from Michelle O.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.267
-We practice our faith
in the smallest of ways.

00:00:45.267 --> 00:00:48.667
With it, we are saying, "I can."

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:50.968
We are saying "I care."

00:00:52.968 --> 00:00:56.334
-Simon says, touch your head.

00:00:57.501 --> 00:01:02.400
Simon says,
touch your shoulders.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:03.400
Press the button.

00:01:06.067 --> 00:01:08.367
Simon didn't say.

00:01:09.767 --> 00:01:11.734
Now pose for a picture.

00:01:11.734 --> 00:01:14.734
Three, two, one.

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:16.467
Turn around.
-Smile, ladies.

00:01:16.467 --> 00:01:18.334
-[ Gasps ]
-Turn around, please.

00:01:18.334 --> 00:01:19.901
-Simon says.
-Oh, my gosh!

00:01:19.901 --> 00:01:23.501
-Smile.
-So nice to meet you.

00:01:23.501 --> 00:01:26.601
-Oh, my gosh!
-Hi. I'm Jimmy.

00:01:26.601 --> 00:01:27.834
-Press the button.

00:01:29.934 --> 00:01:33.667
-We practice our faith
in the smallest of ways.

00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:36.067
With it, we are saying, "I can."

00:01:36.067 --> 00:01:38.834
We are saying, "I care."

00:01:38.834 --> 00:01:42.601
-Simon says touch your head.

00:01:44.267 --> 00:01:46.901
Simon says scream.

00:01:46.901 --> 00:01:49.133
-[ Screams ]

00:01:49.133 --> 00:01:50.601
-Louder.

00:01:50.601 --> 00:01:52.567
-[ Screams ]

00:01:52.567 --> 00:01:54.634
-Simon didn't say
that last one.

00:01:54.634 --> 00:01:56.901
-But Michelle Obama did.
-You lose.

00:02:00.634 --> 00:02:04.133
But maybe you didn't lose.
-Oh, my God!

00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:08.133
Oh, my God!

00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:09.200
Wow!

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:12.968
-Because my mother
had faith in me,

00:02:12.968 --> 00:02:14.901
I had faith in me, too.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.667
-Mother's Day is coming up.

00:02:17.667 --> 00:02:19.334
What are you getting
your mother?

00:02:19.334 --> 00:02:20.400
-Let's see.

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:24.100
-You can pick up
a few books right now.

00:02:27.934 --> 00:02:30.434
-Please buy my book.

00:02:31.901 --> 00:02:33.167
Pretty please?

00:02:33.167 --> 00:02:34.734
-"Pretty please
with sugar on top."

00:02:34.734 --> 00:02:36.100
-With sugar on top?

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:38.434
-Please grab a book and look.
-Are you ready?

00:02:38.434 --> 00:02:41.234
-Oh, my God!
-It's Michelle Obama.

00:02:41.234 --> 00:02:42.734
-Buy my book.

00:02:42.734 --> 00:02:46.868
Tools evolve over time.

00:02:46.868 --> 00:02:50.400
And speaking of time,
it's time to dance.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:53.534
-Oh.
-Show us your best moves.

00:02:58.167 --> 00:03:00.267
Go.

00:03:00.267 --> 00:03:01.267
Drop it low.

00:03:02.734 --> 00:03:04.167
To the floor.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.534
Down lower.

00:03:06.534 --> 00:03:11.601
Go, go, go, go.

00:03:11.601 --> 00:03:16.033
-Now pose for a picture.
Three, two...

00:03:16.033 --> 00:03:18.968
-Go.
-[ Screams ] Oh, my God!

00:03:18.968 --> 00:03:19.968
Oh, my God!

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:23.834
-You've got some great moves.
-Oh, my God!

00:03:26.234 --> 00:03:31.968
-Thank you just for going
through this entire journey

00:03:31.968 --> 00:03:33.534
with grace.

00:03:33.534 --> 00:03:34.968
That's what you are.

00:03:34.968 --> 00:03:38.834
And to have the opportunity
to say that to you, thank you.

00:03:38.834 --> 00:03:41.601
-Oh, sweetie,
that means everything.

00:03:41.601 --> 00:03:43.367
It means everything to me.

00:03:43.367 --> 00:03:46.033
-Ahhh!
-Ahhh!

00:03:46.033 --> 00:03:48.133
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:03:48.133 --> 00:03:50.133
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

